[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16331.59, "timestamp": "04:32:11", "text": "那麼，UPI是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16332.577, "timestamp": "04:32:12", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "you play doom?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16355.99, "timestamp": "04:32:35", "text": "什麼？它類似於線上帳戶或即時支付系統（IMPS）嗎？我們認為"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16359.916, "timestamp": "04:32:39", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "3?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16375.75, "timestamp": "04:32:55", "text": "這是兩全其美的選擇。  UPI 將您的銀行帳戶與虛擬付款地址關聯起來。你可以把它想像成你銀行帳戶的專屬暱稱，這意味著你無需記住帳戶持有人姓名、冗長的帳號或 IFSC 代碼。"}]